---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="이용약관 | tovin Labs"
  description="tovin Labs 서비스 이용약관"
  lang="ko"
>
  <article class="px-6 py-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">이용약관</h1>
    <p class="text-[var(--color-fg-muted)] mb-12">최종 수정일: <span data-placeholder>출시일에 확정</span></p>

    <p class="text-[var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed mb-6">
      본 페이지는 정식 이용약관으로 곧 교체됩니다.
    </p>

    <p class="text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">
      문의: <a href="mailto:hello@tovinlabs.com" class="text-[var(--color-fg)] underline">
        hello@tovinlabs.com
      </a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
